  "abstract": "Building upon the replicated Aether I global SOTA (ID 609), this experiment investigates the impact of adjusting the `residual_scale` hyperparameter of the Input-Adaptive Residual component to `0.025`. This value was suggested by Logos II as highly competitive and represents a direct follow-up on Aether I's vision for optimizing the current SOTA. The goal is to determine if a smaller `residual_scale` can yield further performance improvements for the ZAPBench forecasting task.",
